Original change's description:
> [maps] Normalize non-extensible root maps in MapUpdater
>
> A root map can already be non-extensible when an elements kind
> transition omits inserting a transition (e.g., transitioning to
> DICTIONARY_ELEMENTS). If a subsequent integrity level or private field
> transition is attached to such a root map, MapUpdater cannot replay the
> transition from an extensible root map and must normalize instead.
>
